---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service — Lociate" description="Lociate terms of service. Read the terms governing your use of the Lociate app and services.">
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-12">Effective Date: March 25, 2026 &middot; Last Updated: March 25, 2026</p>

      <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none space-y-10 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">

        <!-- Introduction -->
        <div>
          <p>
            These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your use of Lociate, a mobile application provided by Pearson Media ("we," "our," or "us"). By downloading, installing, or using Lociate, you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use the app.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 1. Acceptable Use -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">1. Acceptable Use</h2>
          <p>You agree to use Lociate in compliance with all applicable laws. You may not:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 mt-3">
            <li>Use Lociate for any unlawful purpose or to record without the consent of parties where required by law</li>
            <li>Attempt to reverse-engineer, decompile, or extract the source code of the app</li>
            <li>Interfere with or disrupt Lociate's services, servers, or infrastructure</li>
            <li>Transmit malicious code, spam, or unauthorized data through Lociate's sync services</li>
            <li>Create accounts using false or misleading information</li>
            <li>Share your account credentials with others or allow unauthorized access</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">We reserve the right to suspend or terminate your access if you violate these Terms.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 2. Your Content -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">2. Your Content</h2>
          <p><strong>You own your data.</strong> All voice recordings, transcriptions, and location-tagged notes ("Lociate") you create remain your property. We do not claim any ownership or license over your content.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">When you use cloud sync (Premium or Family plan), you grant us a limited license to store and transmit your content solely for the purpose of providing the sync service to you. This license terminates when you delete your data or your account.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">You are responsible for the content you create. Do not record content that is illegal, harmful, or infringes on the rights of others.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 3. Subscriptions & Payments -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">3. Subscriptions &amp; Payments</h2>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mt-5 mb-2">Free Tier</h3>
          <p>Lociate offers a free tier with limited features (up to 10 loci, no cloud sync). The free tier is available without any payment or subscription.</p>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mt-5 mb-2">Premium &amp; Family Plans</h3>
          <p>Paid subscriptions are available for additional features. Pricing is as follows:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 mt-2">
            <li><strong>Premium:</strong> $3.99/month or $29.99/year</li>
            <li><strong>Family:</strong> $5.99/month or $44.99/year (up to 6 household members)</li>
            <li><strong>Lifetime:</strong> One-time purchase options available</li>
          </ul>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mt-5 mb-2">Billing &amp; Renewal</h3>
          <p>All subscriptions are processed through Apple's App Store. By subscribing, you agree to Apple's terms of payment. Subscriptions automatically renew unless you cancel at least 24 hours before the end of the current billing period.</p>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mt-5 mb-2">Free Trial</h3>
          <p>Premium plans include a 7-day free trial. You will not be charged during the trial period. If you do not cancel before the trial ends, your subscription will begin and you will be charged.</p>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mt-5 mb-2">Refunds</h3>
          <p>All purchases are handled through the Apple App Store. Refund requests must be submitted directly to Apple. We do not process refunds ourselves. To request a refund, visit <a href="https://reportaproblem.apple.com" class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">reportaproblem.apple.com</a>.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 4. Apple App Store EULA -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">4. Apple App Store Terms</h2>
          <p>Lociate is distributed through the Apple App Store. Your use of the app is also subject to Apple's <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/" class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Licensed Application End User License Agreement</a> (Standard EULA). In the event of a conflict between these Terms and Apple's EULA, Apple's EULA shall prevail to the extent required.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">You acknowledge that:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 mt-2">
            <li>These Terms are between you and Pearson Media, not Apple</li>
            <li>Pearson Media, not Apple, is solely responsible for Lociate and its content</li>
            <li>Apple has no obligation to provide maintenance or support for Lociate</li>
            <li>Apple is not responsible for any claims related to your use of Lociate</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- 5. Service Availability -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">5. Service Availability</h2>
          <p>Lociate is designed as an offline-first application. Core features — recording, playback, transcription, and proximity notifications — work without an internet connection.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Cloud sync, account management, and household sharing features require an internet connection and depend on our backend services. We strive for high availability but do not guarantee uninterrupted access. We may temporarily suspend services for maintenance, updates, or circumstances beyond our control.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">We reserve the right to modify, suspend, or discontinue any part of Lociate's services with reasonable notice. If we discontinue the sync service, we will provide a way for you to export your cloud-stored data.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 6. Limitation of Liability -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law:</p>
