            <li>In no event shall Pearson Media be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, including but not limited to loss of data, revenue, or profits, arising out of your use of or inability to use Lociate.</li>
            <li>Our total liability for any claim arising from these Terms or your use of Lociate shall not exceed the amount you paid us in the twelve (12) months preceding the claim, or $50, whichever is greater.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">Some jurisdictions do not allow the exclusion of certain warranties or limitation of liability. In such jurisdictions, our liability is limited to the greatest extent permitted by law.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 7. Indemnification -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">7. Indemnification</h2>
          <p>You agree to indemnify and hold harmless Pearson Media from any claims, damages, losses, or expenses (including reasonable attorney's fees) arising from your use of Lociate, your content, or your violation of these Terms.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 8. Termination -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">8. Termination</h2>
          <p>You may stop using Lociate at any time by deleting the app. To cancel a subscription, manage it through your Apple ID settings.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">We may terminate or suspend your access to Lociate's services if you violate these Terms. Upon termination, your right to use cloud services ceases, but your locally stored data remains on your device.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">To request account and data deletion, contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@useloci.com" class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 underline">hello@useloci.com</a>.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 9. Governing Law -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">9. Governing Law</h2>
          <p>These Terms are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the United States. Any disputes arising from these Terms shall be resolved in the courts of competent jurisdiction.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 10. Changes to These Terms -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">10. Changes to These Terms</h2>
          <p>We may update these Terms from time to time. When we make material changes, we will notify you through the app or by updating the "Last Updated" date at the top of this page. Your continued use of Lociate after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated Terms.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 11. Contact Us -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">11. Contact Us</h2>
          <p>If you have questions about these Terms, contact us:</p>
          <ul class="list-none pl-0 space-y-1 mt-3">
            <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:hello@useloci.com" class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 underline">hello@useloci.com</a></li>
            <li><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="/support" class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 underline">useloci.com/support</a></li>
